# The artifacts themselves are published as GitHub release assets, never committed.
#
# Git history is permanent: a committed checkpoint is carried by every clone forever and
# cannot be removed without rewriting history. Release assets are free, do not count toward
# repository size, and can be replaced. This ignore list is a safety net so that copying
# artifacts into this folder and running "git add ." cannot undo that decision.
*.pth
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.npz
*.pkl
*.h5
*.safetensors